{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nA contradiction exists"}
{"type":"thought","data":" between the plan and"}
{"type":"thought","data":" spec over whether the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" gate uses `<feature>`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" or `<stem>`. This is"}
{"type":"thought","data":" a real internal inconsistency."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The calibration also"}
{"type":"thought","data":" planted three defects"}
{"type":"thought","data":" on top of an already"}
{"type":"thought","data":" audited plan."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe stem wording was"}
{"type":"thought","data":" added in v1.10 after"}
{"type":"thought","data":" plan audit v8 as a "}
{"type":"thought","data":"post-audit sweep, but"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the spec was never "}
{"type":"thought","data":"updated to match. A "}
{"type":"thought","data":"thorough auditor should"}
{"type":"thought","data":" flag this as a must-fix"}
{"type":"thought","data":" restatement. The risk"}
{"type":"thought","data":" of a false positive"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is mitigated because"}
{"type":"thought","data":" machine scoring validates"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the report structure"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and headings rather"}
{"type":"thought","data":" than matching findings"}
{"type":"thought","data":" against a gold list."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe contradiction "}
{"type":"thought","data":"will be reported as "}
{"type":"thought","data":"a must-fix because it"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is a real Axis C restatement"}
{"type":"thought","data":" of FR-3. It would change"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the implementer's marker"}
{"type":"thought","data":" string and the spec"}
{"type":"thought","data":" remains stale. I am"}
{"type":"thought","data":" checking whether the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" plan's `<feature>` "}
{"type":"thought","data":"wording clarifies the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" stem, which the spec"}
{"type":"thought","data":" could absorb. Axis "}
{"type":"thought","data":"C requires quoting both"}
{"type":"thought","data":" forms and stating which"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is narrower.\n\nThe plan deliberately"}
{"type":"thought","data":" redefines `<feature>`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" as the dot-free transport"}
{"type":"thought","data":" basename stem, not "}
{"type":"thought","data":"the feature name. The"}
{"type":"thought","data":" spec still uses `<feature>`,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" so this is a confirmed"}
{"type":"thought","data":" restatement. It will"}
{"type":"thought","data":" be reported as a must-fix."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe scope section "}
{"type":"thought","data":"also uses `<feature>`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" without the stem clarification,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" so it is another contradiction."}
{"type":"thought","data":" I will consolidate "}
{"type":"thought","data":"both issues into a single"}
{"type":"thought","data":" must-fix finding that"}
{"type":"thought","data":" quotes both plan sites"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and the spec. I am "}
{"type":"thought","data":"also checking whether"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the spec's `<feature>`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" placeholder is meant"}
{"type":"thought","data":" to be a generic convention"}
{"type":"thought","data":" rather than a literal"}
{"type":"thought","data":" field name."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nAxis C treats the "}
{"type":"thought","data":"spec as the source of"}
{"type":"thought","data":" truth. A plan that "}
{"type":"thought","data":"diverges must update"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the spec, even if the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" design document matches"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the plan. I will check"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the design document"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and implementation "}
{"type":"thought","data":"plan to confirm whether"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the spec is the stale"}
{"type":"thought","data":" artifact."}
