{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nAC-3.1 does not assert"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the feature slot content,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" so it cannot test the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" stem-versus-feature"}
{"type":"thought","data":" divergence. The plan’s"}
{"type":"thought","data":" ellipsis is an abbreviation"}
{"type":"thought","data":" of the spec text rather"}
{"type":"thought","data":" than a deletion, and"}
{"type":"thought","data":" will not be treated"}
{"type":"thought","data":" as a missing clause."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nI am counting mutations"}
{"type":"thought","data":" in the spec and JSON"}
{"type":"thought","data":" to verify the exact"}
{"type":"thought","data":" tally. The plan requirements"}
{"type":"thought","data":" drop CONFLICT from "}
{"type":"thought","data":"the registry names, "}
{"type":"thought","data":"but the Goals line, "}
{"type":"thought","data":"Architecture section,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" spec, and AC-5.4 still"}
{"type":"thought","data":" require it. I am also"}
{"type":"thought","data":" checking whether FR-5"}
{"type":"thought","data":" still mandates halting"}
{"type":"thought","data":" on non-OK registry "}
{"type":"thought","data":"entries."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe Requirements bullet"}
{"type":"thought","data":" omits CONFLICT from"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the registry token "}
{"type":"thought","data":"alternation, but the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" Goals line still lists"}
{"type":"thought","data":" it. This internal contradiction"}
{"type":"thought","data":" would change the CLI"}
{"type":"thought","data":" contract if an implementer"}
{"type":"thought","data":" copied the Requirements"}
{"type":"thought","data":" line literally. It "}
{"type":"thought","data":"is a restated finding"}
{"type":"thought","data":" with a narrower token"}
{"type":"thought","data":" set, not an absent "}
{"type":"thought","data":"requirement."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe CONFLICT contradiction"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is a must-fix regardless"}
{"type":"thought","data":" of whether the requirement"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is classified as restated"}
{"type":"thought","data":" or implemented-as-written,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" because it creates "}
{"type":"thought","data":"a hard gap in the stated"}
{"type":"thought","data":" contract. The test "}
{"type":"thought","data":"filename claim was also"}
{"type":"thought","data":" verified: the referenced"}
{"type":"thought","data":" file does not exist,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" but `test_h_mad_audit_cycle_docs.py`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" contains the expected"}
{"type":"thought","data":" anchors."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe spec names the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" docs file in AC-5.2,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" but the plan's risk"}
{"type":"thought","data":" points to a nonexistent"}
{"type":"thought","data":" test. This would misdirect"}
{"type":"thought","data":" an implementer into"}
{"type":"thought","data":" editing the wrong file."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The anchor text is "}
