{"type":"thought","data":"The design grep located"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the plan but not the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" design document."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe design document"}
{"type":"thought","data":" may be archived rather"}
{"type":"thought","data":" than in docs/01-plan."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The plan also misstates"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the new_gate contract:"}
{"type":"thought","data":" it claims cannot-judge"}
{"type":"thought","data":" carries no counts and"}
{"type":"thought","data":" exits 0, but the actual"}
{"type":"thought","data":" script exits 2 on a"}
{"type":"thought","data":" cannot-judge.\n\nThe plan groups the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" three new_gate invariants"}
{"type":"thought","data":" together. The actual"}
{"type":"thought","data":" script exits 0 on PASS"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and FAIL verdicts, "}
{"type":"thought","data":"but exits 2 on a cannot-judge."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The bidirectional docs"}
{"type":"thought","data":" pinning requirement"}
{"type":"thought","data":" still needs verification."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe plan's \"exit 0"}
{"type":"thought","data":" on any verdict\" refers"}
{"type":"thought","data":" only to PASS and FAIL."}
{"type":"thought","data":" This is consistent "}
{"type":"thought","data":"with the COLLECT contract."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The real tension is"}
{"type":"thought","data":" that new_gate gives"}
{"type":"thought","data":" cannot-judge zero counts"}
{"type":"thought","data":" because zero reads "}
{"type":"thought","data":"as clean, but FR-3 and"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the audit gate print"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `must=0 should=0` for"}
{"type":"thought","data":" INVALID."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe audit gate prints"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `must=0 should=0` for"}
{"type":"thought","data":" INVALID. This violates"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the new_gate invariant"}
{"type":"thought","data":" that a cannot-judge"}
{"type":"thought","data":" carries no counts. "}
{"type":"thought","data":"The plan copies this"}
{"type":"thought","data":" shape while citing "}
{"type":"thought","data":"new_gate's rule. The"}
{"type":"thought","data":" assumption table says"}
{"type":"thought","data":" GATE_RE requires must="}
{"type":"thought","data":" and should=. This raises"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the question of whether"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the audit gate is an"}
{"type":"thought","data":" exception."}
